{"hymn":"S455","parent":"E587","quality":"exact","adjust":{"hold":0,"merge":0},"title":"Es tan dulce ir con Cristo","subtitle":"Experiencia de Cristo—Andar con Él","syl":{"n1":"Es","n2":"tan","n4":["dul","i"],"n5":["ce","t"],"n6":"ir","n7":"con","n8":["Cris","i"],"n9":["to,","t"],"n10":["Pa","i"],"n11":["so‿a","m"],"n12":["pa","m"],"n13":["so,","t"],"n14":"vez","n15":"tras","n16":"vez;","n17":"Ir","n18":["pi","i"],"n20":["san","m"],"n21":["do‿a","m"],"n22":["sí","t"],"n23":"Sus","n24":["hue","i"],"n25":["llas","t"],"n26":["Y‿has","i"],"n27":["ta‿el","t"],"n28":"fin","n29":["an","i"],"n30":["dar","t"],"n31":"con","n32":"Él.","n33":["Pa","i"],"n34":["so","t"],"n35":"a","n36":["pa","i"],"n37":["so‿i","m"],"n38":["ré","t"],"n39":["Jun","i"],"n40":["to","t"],"n41":"con","n42":"mi","n43":["Cris","i"],"n44":["to;","t"],"n45":["Has","i"],"n46":["ta‿el","t"],"n47":"fin","n48":["se","i"],"n49":["gui","m"],"n50":["ré","t"],"n51":["To","i"],"n52":["do‿el","t"],"n53":["dí","i"],"n54":["a‿a","t"],"n55":["Cris","i"],"n56":["to.","t"]},"verses":[{"label":"2.","lines":["Con Jesús andando‿a diario,","Nada daño nos hará;","Apoyados de Su brazo,","Él nos guía‿hasta‿el final."]},{"label":"3.","lines":["Con Jesús en cada paso,","Un momento a la vez,","Cumbres que‿antes no‿alcanzaba","Paso‿a paso subiré."]},{"label":"4.","lines":["Con Jesús voy caminado","Día‿y noche, hasta‿el fin,","Aunque Sus pisadas guíen","Al sepulcro o‿al jardín."]},{"label":"5.","lines":["Con Jesús aquí andamos","Mas pasando‿el tiempo va;","Cambiará la noche en día,","Y la pena‿en el cantar."]},{"label":"6.","lines":["Luego,‿en vestiduras blancas,","Andaremos con Jesús;","Cambiará el llanto en gozo","Y la‿oscuridad en luz."]},{"label":"7.","lines":["Oh Jesús, mantenme cerca,","Paso‿a paso, vez tras vez;","Y, pisando‿así Tus huellas,","Hasta‿el fin te seguiré."]}]}